claims[163]{question_id,source_id,claim}:
  cal-20261002-s2-001,s1,The todo asks for the audit by 9 October 2026.
  cal-20261002-s2-001,s2,cal-20261002-033 was answered 87%; cal-20261002-032 was answered 86%.
  cal-20261002-s2-001,s3,Deleting a repository through the REST API needs the Administration permission with write access.
  cal-20261002-s2-009,s1,Many actions got 85-100% while cal-20261002-078 got 21%.
  cal-20261002-s2-009,s2,cal-20261002-078 was answered 21%.
  cal-20261002-s2-012,s1,cal-20261002-030 is one of the ten swapped questions.
  cal-20261002-s2-012,s2,cal-20261002-030 was answered 22% on the proposition that many crewmates teach more.
  cal-20261002-s2-013,s1,cal-20261002-001 was answered 83% but its high action was to pause porting.
  cal-20261002-s2-013,s2,"After 03:20Z on 2 October, site commits were Calibrator fixes and notes, with no new visualisation ports."
  cal-20261002-s2-003,s1,The todo asks to send beamdiag to one practising structural engineer by 9 October 2026.
  cal-20261002-s2-003,s2,cal-20261002-063 was answered 100%; cal-20261002-061 was answered 81%.
  cal-20261002-s2-022,s1,"Groß: £5.8m, 47 points, form 10.7, 29.0% owned."
  cal-20261002-s2-022,s1,"Igor Thiago: £7.8m, 10 points on 3.29 expected goal involvements."
  cal-20261002-s2-022,s2,The note leaves the Groß and Thiago contradiction to settle before the deadline.
  cal-20261002-s2-002,s1,Repository deletion is listed under the Administration permission (write).
  cal-20261002-s2-002,s2,"cal-20261002-002, freezing new standalone repositories for two weeks, was answered 22%."
  cal-20261002-s2-002,s3,60 public yujieteo repositories; most visualisations have a standalone mirror.
  cal-20261002-s2-033,s1,"Stage B compares checksums, requires HTTP 200 and checks the served HTML for expected text."
  cal-20261002-s2-033,s2,cal-20261002-031 was answered 12%.
  cal-20261002-s2-036,s1,9b7bbc8 and f650447 were pushed straight to site main with no pull request.
  cal-20261002-s2-036,s2,"The article argues a system prompt is advisory, not an enforceable safety layer."
  cal-20261002-s2-072,s1,"All 100 questions took about 17 minutes, with a median of 6.3 seconds."
  cal-20261002-s2-023,s1,"The guide suggests building around Saka, Arsenal defence, Groß, Haaland and targeted value."
  cal-20261002-s2-023,s2,cal-20261002-014 was answered 93%.
  cal-20261002-s2-046,s1,cal-20261002-092 was answered 18%; cal-20261002-003 was answered 93%.
  cal-20261002-s2-089,s1,The note records 20% that the site stays notes-first.
  cal-20261002-s2-089,s2,cal-20261002-095 was answered 20%; cal-20261002-047 was answered 24%.
  cal-20261002-s2-034,s1,The note records 86% on an agent failure but 12% on outrunning verification.
  cal-20261002-s2-034,s2,The catalogue holds 55 visualisations.
  cal-20261002-s2-021,s1,raw.toon keeps the swapped answers as credences in the propositions.
  cal-20261002-s2-005,s1,"The note takes the 93% as the decision: no VGC until November."
  cal-20261002-s2-005,s2,cal-20261002-025 was answered 88%; cal-20261002-021 was answered 93%.
  cal-20261002-s2-040,s1,The curfew note cites 88% on agent work cutting into exercise and sleep.
  cal-20261002-s2-040,s2,The site's commit rate peaked at 50 on 1 October.
  cal-20261002-s2-006,s1,The todo asks for one first-hand observation a day for seven days from 3 October 2026.
  cal-20261002-s2-006,s2,cal-20261002-077 was answered 96%; cal-20261002-003 was answered 93%.
  cal-20261002-s2-015,s1,cal-20261002-048 is one of the ten swapped questions.
  cal-20261002-s2-015,s2,cal-20261002-048 was answered 82%.
  cal-20261002-s2-010,s1,The note says to choose the squad between 7 and 10 October.
  cal-20261002-s2-010,s2,cal-20261002-017 was answered 92%.
  cal-20261002-s2-041,s1,Claude Sonnet 5.5 was released on 28 September 2026.
  cal-20261002-s2-041,s1,It costs $2 per million input tokens and $10 per million output tokens.
